you a Xiao Lantern.","nextNodeIds":[413410204]},{"nodeId":413410204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":2536634234,"text":"...Really?","nextNodeIds":[413410205]},{"nodeId":413410205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211801,"speakerName":"Mengmeng","textMapHash":2080572050,"text":"Yu, the Xiao Lantern's for you.","nextNodeIds":[413410206]},{"nodeId":413410206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":2471286090,"text":"Mengmeng? Oh, did you make this...? Wow... thank you...","nextNodeIds":[413410207]},{"nodeId":413410207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211801,"speakerName":"Mengmeng","textMapHash":297018290,"text":"#This {M#nice man}{F#nice lady} taught me how to make them. Actually, it's one of my first, so I didn't do a great job... D—Do you like it...?","nextNodeIds":[413410208]},{"nodeId":413410208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":812470074,"text":"Are you kidding? It's great, I love it! I was just starting to worry when I'd have the time to make one for myself...","nextNodeIds":[413410209]},{"nodeId":413410209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":4070412250,"text":"Thanks, Mengmeng. I'll find someone to hang it on my door in a bit.","nextNodeIds":[413410210,413410211]},{"nodeId":413410210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":544394658,"text":"Hang it up? What for?","nextNodeIds":[413410212]},{"nodeId":413410212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":3983505626,"text":"Well, the thing is... My dad's not in great health, so he can't hang it up for me. And I'm too short, so I wouldn't be able to reach...","nextNodeIds":[413410213]},{"nodeId":413410213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":1059949154,"text":"So, if I wanna hang it on the door, I gotta ask someone around here if they can help...","nextNodeIds":[413410214,413410215]},{"nodeId":413410214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":459845170,"text":"We can help.","nextNodeIds":[413410216]},{"nodeId":413410216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":211901,"speakerName":"Yu","textMapHash":2257072442,"text":"Really? You sure you don't mind helping? ...That's great, thanks! Now I don't need to worry about who'd watch the shop if I went off looking for someone to help...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":413410215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2519856074,"text":"Let us help.","nextNodeIds":[413410216]},{"nodeId":413410211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4204799922,"text":"Can't someone in your family help?","nextNodeIds":[413410212]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4134102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["211901"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4134103,"order":4,"stepDescription":"Hang Xiao Lantern","stepDescTextMapHash":3477903772,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[71700184,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_INTERACT_GADGET","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAU